{'symbol': 'DG', 'date': '2019-12-04 22:30:00', 'title': 'DOLLAR GENERAL CORPORATION DECLARES CASH DIVIDEND, PAYABLE ON OR BEFORE JANUARY 21, 2020', 'text': 'DOLLAR GENERAL CORPORATION ANNOUNCED COMPANY’S BOARD OF DIRECTORS DECLARED A QUARTERLY CASH DIVIDEND OF $0.32 PER SHARE ON THE COMPANY’S COMMON STOCK, PAYABLE ON OR BEFORE JANUARY 21, 2020 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD ON JANUARY 7, 2020.'}